    "title": "Roth IRA vs. Traditional IRA: How to Choose the Right Account",
    "question": "Should I choose a Roth IRA or a traditional IRA, and how do I know which is better for my situation?",
    "summary": "A Roth IRA offers tax-free withdrawals in retirement using after-tax contributions, while a Traditional IRA provides a potential tax deduction now with taxable withdrawals later. Choosing between them depends primarily on whether your tax rate is expected to be higher now or in retirement.",
